        <body>
            <div xml:id="d505-a18">

                <pb facs="0568" n="518" sameAs="frus:frus1894/pg518"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Document No. 18.—From Buenos Ayres to
                        Lisbon.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1894-03-26"><hi rendition="#small-caps">March</hi> 26,
                        1894</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#italic">Secretary of Admiralty:</hi></p>
                <p>The corvette arrived to-day safely. Ten days of quarantine. I await orders from
                    our Government to disembark 251 passengers.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Teves.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
